<title>UK: BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.05 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.05 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited UK money market operators to offer band 1 and 2 bills and an unrestricted bill/FRG repo to November 15 and 18 in exchange for cash to help alleviate a revised forecast 1.05 billion stg liquidity shortage in the market.</p>
</text>
